venus.wasm: the licences of what it is built from
=================================================

The page's Vulkan renderer (MIT, see LICENSE) is one WebAssembly module made by
vk/build.sh from:

- virglrenderer (commit e0a1caf3b147): its Venus renderer (src/venus/) and its copy of Mesa's util. MIT: its
  COPYING, below. Patched by webpc (vk/patches/vkr-wasm.patch, MIT).
- Mesa (mesa-26.2.4): the Vulkan runtime, spirv_to_nir, NIR, the GLSL types, util and c11. MIT (docs/license.rst and
  the MIT text, below), with:
  - Berkeley SoftFloat 3e in src/util/softfloat.c: BSD-3-Clause, its notice below;
  - BLAKE3 in src/util/blake3/: dedicated to the public domain under CC0-1.0 (or Apache-2.0, or Apache-2.0 WITH
    LLVM-exception, at your choice);
  - src/c11/impl/threads_posix.c: BSL-1.0, below.
- webpc's driver (vk/driver/), translator (vk/compiler/) and glue (vk/glue.c, vk/wasi/): MIT.
- wasi-sdk 34: wasi-libc (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception, Apache-2.0 or MIT; its musl parts MIT, "Copyright © 2005-2020
  Rich Felker, et al."; dlmalloc and its other parts public domain or CC0-1.0, cloudlibc BSD-2-Clause, musl-fts
  BSD-3-Clause) and compiler-rt and libc++ (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception): the Apache-2.0 text and the LLVM
  exception, below.

